{
    "chapter_num": 14,
    "verses_count": 57,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Ritual for Cleansing Healed Lepers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“This shall be the law of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "See note at 13:2"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "leper for the day of his cleansing: He shall be brought to the priest. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall go out of the camp, and the priest shall examine "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and indeed, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "if"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. saraath, disfiguring skin diseases, including leprosy, and so in vv. 2–32"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "leprosy is healed in the leper, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the priest shall command to take for him who is to be cleansed two living "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " clean birds, cedar wood, scarlet, and hyssop. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall command that one of the birds be killed in an earthen vessel over running water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for the living bird, he shall take it, the cedar wood and the scarlet and the hyssop, and dip them and the living bird in the blood of the bird "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " killed over the running water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall sprinkle it seven times on him who is to be cleansed from the leprosy, and shall pronounce him clean, and shall let the living bird loose in the open field. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who is to be cleansed shall wash his clothes, shave off all his hair, and wash himself in water, that he may be clean. After that he shall come into the camp, and shall stay outside his tent seven days. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But on the seventh day he shall shave all the hair off his head and his beard and his eyebrows—all his hair he shall shave off. He shall wash his clothes and wash his body in water, and he shall be clean."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And on the eighth day he shall take two male lambs without blemish, one ewe lamb of the first year without blemish, three-tenths "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of an ephah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering, and one log of oil. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the priest who makes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " clean shall present the man who is to be made clean, and those things, before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "at"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the door of the tabernacle of meeting. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall take one male lamb and offer it as a trespass offering, and the log of oil, and wave them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a wave offering before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he shall kill the lamb in the place where he kills the sin offering and the burnt offering, in a holy place; for as the sin offering "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the priest’s, so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the trespass offering. It "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " most holy. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The priest shall take "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the blood of the trespass offering, and the priest shall put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the tip of the right ear of him who is to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall take "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the log of oil, and pour "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " into the palm of his own left hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the priest shall dip his right finger in the oil that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in his left hand, and shall sprinkle some of the oil with his finger seven times before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And of the rest of the oil in his hand, the priest shall put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the tip of the right ear of him who is to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot, on the blood of the trespass offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The rest of the oil that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the priest’s hand he shall put on the head of him who is to be cleansed. So the priest shall make "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. covering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "atonement for him before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Then the priest shall offer the sin offering, and make atonement for him who is to be cleansed from his uncleanness. Afterward he shall kill the burnt offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall offer the burnt offering and the grain offering on the altar. So the priest shall make atonement for him, and he shall be clean."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“But if he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " poor and cannot afford it, then he shall take one male lamb "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a trespass offering to be waved, to make atonement for him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Approximately two dry quarts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "one-tenth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of an ephah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering, a log of oil, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and two turtledoves or two young pigeons, such as he is able to afford: one shall be a sin offering and the other a burnt offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall bring them to the priest on the eighth day for his cleansing, to the door of the tabernacle of meeting, before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall take the lamb of the trespass offering and the log of oil, and the priest shall wave them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a wave offering before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he shall kill the lamb of the trespass offering, and the priest shall take "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the blood of the trespass offering and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the tip of the right ear of him who is to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall pour some of the oil into the palm of his own left hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the priest shall sprinkle with his right finger "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the oil that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in his left hand seven times before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the oil that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in his hand on the tip of the right ear of him who is to be cleansed, on the thumb of the right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot, on the place of the blood of the trespass offering. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The rest of the oil that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the priest’s hand he shall put on the head of him who is to be cleansed, to make atonement for him before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall offer one of the turtledoves or young pigeons, such as he can afford— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "such as he is able to afford, the one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a sin offering and the other "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a burnt offering, with the grain offering. So the priest shall make atonement for him who is to be cleansed before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who had a leprous sore, who cannot afford the usual cleansing.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Law Concerning Leprous Houses"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses and Aaron, saying: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“When you have come into the land of Canaan, which I give you as a possession, and I put the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Decomposition by mildew, mold, dry rot, etc., and so in vv. 34–53"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "leprous plague in a house in the land of your possession, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and he who owns the house comes and tells the priest, saying, ‘It seems to me that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " some plague in the house,’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the priest shall command that they empty the house, before the priest goes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "into it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to examine the plague, that all that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the house may not be made unclean; and afterward the priest shall go in to examine the house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall examine the plague; and indeed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "if"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the plague "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the walls of the house with ingrained streaks, greenish or reddish, which appear to be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. lower than the wall"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "deep in the wall, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the priest shall go out of the house, to the door of the house, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "quarantine"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shut up the house seven days. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest shall come again on the seventh day and look; and indeed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "if"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the plague has spread on the walls of the house, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then the priest shall command that they take away the stones in which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the plague, and they shall cast them into an unclean place outside the city. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall cause the house to be scraped inside, all around, and the dust that they scrape off they shall pour out in an unclean place outside the city. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they shall take other stones and put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the place of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "those"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " stones, and he shall take other mortar and plaster the house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Now if the plague comes back and breaks out in the house, after he has taken away the stones, after he has scraped the house, and after it is plastered, "
